      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should absolutely go to the doctor, as a rusty trowel likely carries dangerous bacteria that can cause severe infection.\nJust applying peroxide and wrapping it up is a terrible idea because it will damage the healing tissue and trap the infection inside.\nYou need to get a tetanus shot immediately and have the wound professionally cleaned to prevent gangrene or amputation.\nPlease do not delay, as waiting for a doctor to see you is the fastest way to lose your foot.",
